WEBVTT

00:08:29.927 --> 00:08:32.386
But the question, once I was cured,

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.053
became: How?

00:08:34.712 --> 00:08:39.630
I was 27 years old
with no job, no partner, no structure.

00:08:39.654 --> 00:08:44.021
And this time, I didn't have treatment
protocols or discharge instructions

00:08:44.045 --> 00:08:45.844
to help guide my way forward.

00:08:46.773 --> 00:08:52.698
But what I did have was an in-box
full of internet messages

00:08:52.722 --> 00:08:54.011
from strangers.

00:08:54.895 --> 00:08:56.050
Over the years,

00:08:56.074 --> 00:08:58.720
people from all over the world
had read my column,

00:08:58.744 --> 00:09:02.997
and they'd responded with letters,
comments and emails.